Computing [3/2] temporal Padé approximant for the 2D heat equation...
 f0 = sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)
 f1 = -2*pi**2*kappa*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)
 f2 = 4*pi**4*kappa**2*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)
 f3 = -8*pi**6*kappa**3*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)
 f4 = 16*pi**8*kappa**4*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)
 f5 = -32*pi**10*kappa**5*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)
 b0 = 1  (normalised)
 b1 = 4*pi**2*kappa/5
 b2 = pi**4*kappa**2/5
 a0 = sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)
 a1 = -6*pi**2*kappa*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)/5
 a2 = 3*pi**4*kappa**2*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)/5
 a3 = -2*pi**6*kappa**3*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)/15
 P[3/2](x,t) = (-2*pi**6*kappa**3*t**3*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)/15 + 3*pi**4*kappa**2*t**2*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)/5 - 6*pi**2*kappa*t*sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y)/5 + sin(pi*x)*sin(pi*y))/(pi**4*kappa**2*t**2/5 + 4*pi**2*kappa*t/5 + 1)


